          "name": "ChartTooltipConfig",
          "description": "<p>Chart tooltip configuration object that defines the appearance and behavior of chart tooltip. See\nthe <a href=\"https://www.chartjs.org/docs/latest/configuration/tooltip.html\">ChartJS documentation</a> for more information.</p>",
