          "description": "<p>Generates an id for a new record (a phantom id), based on a UUID by default.</p>\n<p>This function can be overridden to provide custom id generation logic.</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>let idCounter = 0;\n// Override the default logic with app specific\nModel.generateId = () => `id${new Date().getTime()}${idCounter++}`;\n</code></pre>",
