              "description": "<p>Configuration object, accepts options specified under Configs above</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>new DragHelper({\n  containers: [div1, div2],\n  isElementDraggable: element => element.className.contains('handle'),\n  outerElement: topParent,\n  listeners: {\n    drop: onDrop,\n    thisObj: this\n  }\n});\n</code></pre>"
