      "modulePath": "Core/helper/ElementResizeHelper",
      "classDescription": "<p>A simple utility class offering minimal two-dimensional resizer that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Uses &quot;top&quot; for vertical positioning</li>\n<li>Uses &quot;inset-inline-start&quot; for horizontal positioning (logical property)</li>\n<li>Adjusts width/height as well</li>\n</ul>",
