          "description": "<p>The lazily created <code>InfinityScroller</code>. For derived classes, see <a href=\"#Core/helper/util/InfinityScrollable#property-infinityScrollerDefaults\">infinityScrollerDefaults</a>.</p>",
          "scope": "inner",
