          "description": "<p>Given the return value from a call to <a href=\"#Core/mixin/Delayable#function-queueMicrotask\">queueMicrotask</a>, cancels the pending call. This method is\nprovided for symmetry with other timer functions, such as <a href=\"#Core/mixin/Delayable#function-setTimeout\">setTimeout</a>.</p>",
          "scope": "instance",
