          "description": "<p>Set to <code>true</code> to call onXXX method names (e.g. <code>onShow</code>, <code>onClick</code>), as an easy way to listen for events.</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>const container = new Container({\n    callOnFunctions : true\n\n    onHide() {\n         // Do something when the 'hide' event is fired\n    }\n});\n</code></pre>",
