          "description": "<p>Set to <code>true</code> to use <a href=\"#Core/widget/Panel#config-trapFocus\">trapFocus</a> to scroll the carousel when tabbing to slots\nthat are not currently visible.</p>\n<p>NOTE: This only works when <a href=\"#Core/widget/Carousel#config-configureSlot\">configureSlot</a> produces <a href=\"#Core/widget/Panel\">Panel</a> instances.</p>",
