          "description": "<p>Initial value.\n<code>String</code> value allows linking value by reference name.</p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>new Slider({\n    text      : 'Tick height',\n    value     : 100,\n}\n\nnew Slider({\n    text      : 'Tick height',\n    value     : 'up.tickSize',\n}\n</code></pre>",
          "scope": "inner",
