          "description": "<p>Additional configuration for the tab bar.</p>\n<p>Use this to add more non-tab items to the bar:</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>new TabPanel({\n   tabBar : {\n      items : {\n         spacer : '->', // Spacer which moves next item to the right\n         button : { type : 'button', text : 'MyButton' }\n      }\n   }\n});\n</code></pre>",
