          "description": "<p>The <code>colors</code> property can be an array of string CSS colors or of objects with <code>color</code>\nand <code>text</code> properties from which the user can choose from. This will override the\n<a href=\"#Core/widget/ColorPicker#config-colors\">pickers default colors</a>.</p>\n<p>Provide an array of string CSS colors:</p>\n<pre class=\"prettyprint source lang-javascript\"><code>new Grid({\n   columns : [\n      {\n         type   : 'color',\n         field  : 'color',\n         text   : 'Color',\n         colors : ['#00FFFF', '#F0FFFF', '#89CFF0', '#0000FF', '#7393B3']\n      }\n   ]\n});\n</code></pre>",
