      "longname": "module:Grid/feature/ColumnReorder",
      "modulePath": "Grid/feature/ColumnReorder",
      "classDescription": "<p>Allows user to reorder columns by dragging headers. Click and drag a column header to move it to a new position.\nVisual feedback shows the drop target while dragging. To get notified about column reorder, listen to the\n<code>change</code> event on the <a href=\"#Grid/data/ColumnStore\">columns</a> store.</p>\n<p><div class=\"external-example \" data-file=\"Grid/feature/ColumnReorder.js\"></div></p>\n<p>This feature is <strong>enabled</strong> by default.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Grid/feature/ColumnDragToolbar\">ColumnDragToolbar</a> - Toolbar shown during column drag</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Grid/feature/ColumnPicker\">ColumnPicker</a> - Column visibility picker</li>\n</ul>",
