          "description": "<p>The row index which this <code>GridLocation</code> references. (unless <a href=\"#Grid/util/GridLocation#config-record\">record</a> is used to configure).</p>\n<p><code>-1</code> means the header row, in which case the <a href=\"#Grid/util/GridLocation#config-record\">record</a> will be <code>null</code>.</p>",
          "scope": "inner",
          "type": "Number",
