          "description": "<p>The Column which this <code>GridLocation</code> references. (unless <a href=\"#Grid/util/GridLocation#config-columnIndex\">columnIndex</a> or <a href=\"#Grid/util/GridLocation#config-columnId\">columnId</a> is used to configure)</p>",
          "scope": "inner",
