          "description": "<p>Specify <code>false</code> to prevent dependencies from being redrawn during event interaction, such as dragging,\nresizing or rescheduling through other means, including when events animate into place. This makes\ninteraction smoother, but dependency lines will not be updated until the interaction is finished.</p>",
