          "name": "resourceMenuBeforeShow",
          "description": "<p>This event fires on the owning scheduler before the context menu is shown for a resource.\nAllows manipulation of the items to show in the same way as in the <a href=\"#Scheduler/feature/ResourceMenu#config-processItems\">processItems</a>.</p>\n<p>Returning <code>false</code> from a listener prevents the menu from being shown.</p>",
