          "description": "<p>Set it to <code>true</code> to allow dependency creation only for parent events (only applies to Scheduler Pro using the <code>NestedEvents</code> feature). Normally the nested event container\ninside parent events cannot be scrolled when using dependencies, but by enabling this setting and limiting\nto where dependencies can be drawn scrolling will be enabled.</p>",
