      "classDescription": "<p>Base abstract class used by the <a href=\"#Scheduler/feature/EventEdit#config-editorConfig\">editorConfig</a> feature config for the\neditor dialog. Provides the popup container, scrolling, and mobile maximization behavior for event editing.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/feature/EventEdit\">EventEdit</a> - Event edit feature</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/feature/SimpleEventEdit\">SimpleEventEdit</a> - Simple inline event editing</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Core/widget/Popup\">Popup</a> - Base popup class</li>\n</ul>",
      "filename": "EventEditor.js",
