      "modulePath": "Scheduler/view/TimelineHistogramBase",
      "classDescription": "<p>Base class for <a href=\"#Scheduler/view/TimelineHistogram\">TimelineHistogram</a> class. Provides core histogram rendering, series\nmanagement, and tooltip generation. Not to be used directly.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/TimelineHistogram\">TimelineHistogram</a> - Concrete histogram view</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/TimelineBase\">TimelineBase</a> - Timeline base class</li>\n</ul>",
