          "description": "<p>Product agnostic method which yields the <a href=\"#Scheduler/model/ResourceModel\">ResourceModel</a> record which underpins the row which\nencapsulates the passed element. The element can be a grid cell, or an event element, and the result\nwill be a <a href=\"#Scheduler/model/ResourceModel\">ResourceModel</a></p>",
