      "classDescription": "<p>A button which displays the associated <a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceLegendButton#property-recurrence\">recurrence</a> info in a human-readable form. Shows a\nlocalized text description of the recurrence rule (e.g. &quot;Every 2 weeks on Monday, Wednesday&quot;).</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/model/RecurrenceModel\">RecurrenceModel</a> - Recurrence data model</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> - Recurrence editor</li>\n</ul>",
