      "name": "RecurrenceCombo",
      "longname": "module:Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrenceCombo",
      "modulePath": "Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrenceCombo",
      "classDescription": "<p>A combobox field for selecting a recurrence pattern: <code>Daily</code>, <code>Weekly</code>, <code>Monthly</code> or <code>Yearly</code> if the recurrence\nhas no other non-default settings, or <code>Custom...</code> if the recurrence has custom setting applied. Selecting\n<code>Custom...</code> opens the <a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> for detailed configuration.</p>\n<p><div class=\"external-example \" data-file=\"Scheduler/view/RecurrenceCombo.js\"></div></p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> - Recurrence editor dialog</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrenceFrequencyCombo\">RecurrenceFrequencyCombo</a> - Frequency combo base</li>\n</ul>",
