      "modulePath": "Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrenceDaysButtonGroup",
      "classDescription": "<p>A segmented button field allowing you to pick days for the &quot;Weekly&quot; mode in the\n<a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">recurrence dialog</a>. Each button represents a day\nof the week and can be toggled on or off.</p>\n<p><div class=\"external-example \" data-file=\"Scheduler/view/DayButtons.js\"></div></p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/widget/DayButtons\">DayButtons</a> - Base day buttons widget</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> - Recurrence editor dialog</li>\n</ul>",
