      "classDescription": "<p>A combobox field allowing to pick days for the <code>Monthly</code> and <code>Yearly</code> mode in the\n<a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">recurrence dialog</a>. It lists individual weekdays,\na &quot;working days&quot; shortcut, and an &quot;all days&quot; option, letting users define which days a recurring event lands on.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> - Recurrence editor dialog</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/model/RecurrenceModel\">RecurrenceModel</a> - Recurrence data model</li>\n</ul>",
