      "longname": "module:Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrencePositionsCombo",
      "modulePath": "Scheduler/view/recurrence/field/RecurrencePositionsCombo",
      "classDescription": "<p>A combobox field allowing to specify day positions (First, Second, Third, Fourth, Last) in the\n<a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">recurrence editor</a>. Used in <code>Monthly</code> and <code>Yearly</code>\nrecurrence rules to express patterns such as &quot;the second Tuesday of every month&quot;.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/view/recurrence/RecurrenceEditor\">RecurrenceEditor</a> - Recurrence editor dialog</li>\n<li><a href=\"#Scheduler/model/RecurrenceModel\">RecurrenceModel</a> - Recurrence data model</li>\n</ul>",
