      "modulePath": "SchedulerPro/data/calendareditor/CalendarEditorStore",
      "classDescription": "<p>A store providing data for the calendar editor widget.\nIt accepts a <a href=\"#SchedulerPro/data/calendareditor/CalendarEditorStore#config-calendar\">calendar</a> as its input and builds records\nbased on the calendar intervals in the form convenient for the calendar editor.</p>\n<p>This store is heterogeneous and can accept models of two classes -\n<a href=\"#SchedulerPro/model/calendareditor/CalendarEditorExceptionModel\">CalendarEditorExceptionModel</a> and\n<a href=\"#SchedulerPro/model/calendareditor/CalendarEditorWeekModel\">CalendarEditorWeekModel</a>.</p>",
