          "description": "<p>The largest time axis unit to display non working ranges for ('hour' or 'day' etc).\nWhen zooming to a view with a larger unit, no non-working time elements will be rendered.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Be careful with setting this config to big units like 'year'. When doing this,\nmake sure the timeline <a href=\"#Scheduler/view/TimelineBase#config-startDate\">start</a> and\n<a href=\"#Scheduler/view/TimelineBase#config-endDate\">end</a> dates are set tightly.\nWhen using a long range (for example many years) with non-working time elements rendered per hour,\nyou will end up with millions of elements, impacting performance.\nWhen zooming, use the <a href=\"#Scheduler/view/mixin/TimelineZoomable#config-zoomKeepsOriginalTimespan\">zoomKeepsOriginalTimespan</a> config.</p>",
