          "description": "<p>Updates the <a href=\"#SchedulerPro/model/EventModel#field-effort\">effort</a> (and optionally <a href=\"#SchedulerPro/model/EventModel#field-effortUnit\">unit</a>) of the event.\nWill cause the schedule to be updated - returns a <code>Promise</code></p>",
          "scope": "inner",
          "propagating": true,
