          "name": "resolveRecordToOrigin",
          "description": "<p>The view store records wrap &quot;real&quot; resources and assignments.\nThis method resolves a record to its original record resource or assignment.\nIf the record does not wrap any record (happens for example for parent records when\nusing <a href=\"#Grid/feature/TreeGroup\">TreeGroup</a> feature) then the method returns the record itself.</p>",
