      "modulePath": "SchedulerPro/widget/ModelCombo",
      "classDescription": "<p>A special <a href=\"#Core/widget/Combo\">Combo</a> subclass that returns a <a href=\"#Core/data/Model\">Model</a> instance from its store as\nthe field value, rather than a primitive ID. This is useful when the consuming code needs direct access to the\nfull model record. It serves as the base class for several Scheduler Pro field widgets including\n<a href=\"#SchedulerPro/widget/CalendarField\">CalendarField</a> and <a href=\"#SchedulerPro/widget/RateTableField\">RateTableField</a>.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#SchedulerPro/widget/CalendarField\">CalendarField</a> — Subclass used for selecting project calendars</li>\n<li><a href=\"#SchedulerPro/widget/RateTableField\">RateTableField</a> — Subclass used for selecting resource rate tables</li>\n</ul>",
