      "comment": "/**\n * Chart tooltip callback functions configuration object. Refer to the ChartJS tooltip\n * [callbacks](https://www.chartjs.org/docs/latest/configuration/tooltip.html#tooltip-callbacks) documentation for details.\n * @deprecated Since 7.3. ChartJS will be replaced by AG Charts in version 8. This typedef is kept for backwards compatibility\n * and will be removed in a future version.\n * @typedef {Object} ChartTooltipCallbacks\n * @property {Function} [beforeTitle] Callback for customizing tooltip title before rendering\n * @property {Function} [title] Callback for customizing tooltip title\n * @property {Function} [afterTitle] Callback for customizing tooltip title after rendering\n * @property {Function} [beforeBody] Callback for customizing tooltip body before rendering\n * @property {Function} [beforeLabel] Callback for customizing individual labels before rendering\n * @property {Function} [label] Callback for customizing individual labels (most commonly used)\n * @property {Function} [labelColor] Callback for customizing label colors\n * @property {Function} [labelTextColor] Callback for customizing label text colors\n * @property {Function} [labelPointStyle] Callback for customizing label point styles\n * @property {Function} [afterLabel] Callback for customizing individual labels after rendering\n * @property {Function} [afterBody] Callback for customizing tooltip body after rendering\n * @property {Function} [beforeFooter] Callback for customizing tooltip footer before rendering\n * @property {Function} [footer] Callback for customizing tooltip footer\n * @property {Function} [afterFooter] Callback for customizing tooltip footer after rendering\n */",
