          "description": "<p>Set to <code>true</code> to add a checkbox to the selection column header\nto select/deselect all rows. Requires checkbox to also be set to <code>true</code>. <strong>Not supported</strong> when <code>Store</code> is\nconfigured with {@link Core.data.Store#config-lazyLoad}</p>",
